  <entry>
    <title>外观模式</title>
    <link href="/2026/09/07/%E5%A4%96%E8%A7%82%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/"/>
    <url>/2026/09/07/%E5%A4%96%E8%A7%82%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>外观模式：结构型设计模式。它为子系统中的一组接口提供一个统一的高层接口，使得子系统更容易使用。<br>外观模式通过创建一个“门面”类，将客户端与复杂的子系统解耦，客户端只需要与门面交互，而不需要了解子系统内部的复杂细节。</p><h3 id="使用外观模式的好处"><a href="#使用外观模式的好处" class="headerlink" title="使用外观模式的好处"></a>使用外观模式的好处</h3><p>分层隔离，实现解耦：上层只需要调用“门面”类中的方法，不关注底下子系统的实现，而“门面”类方法负责调用不同的子系统方法实现功能。上层只依赖门面类，不直接依赖子系统，减少依赖的数量。<br>外观模式完美地体现了迪米特法则和封装的思想，所以是非常常用的模式之一。</p><h3 id="什么情况适合使用外观模式"><a href="#什么情况适合使用外观模式" class="headerlink" title="什么情况适合使用外观模式"></a>什么情况适合使用外观模式</h3><ol><li>在开发阶段，子系统往往因为不断的重构演化而变得越来越复杂，大多数的模式使用时也都会产生很多很小的类，这本是好事，但也给外部调用它们的用户程序带来了使用上的困难，增加外观Facade可以提供一个简单的接口，减少它们之间的依赖。 </li><li>在维护一个遗留的大型系统时，可能这个系统已经非常难以维护和扩展了，但因为它包含非常重要的功能，新的需求开发必须要依赖于它。此时用外观模式Facade也是非常合适的。你可以为新系统开发一个外观Facade类，来提供设计粗糙或高度复杂的遗留代码的比较清晰简单的接口，让新系统与Facade对象交互，Facade与遗留代码交互所有复杂的工作。</li></ol><h4 id="例子"><a href="#例子" class="headerlink" title="例子"></a>例子</h4><p>假设我们有一套家庭影院设备，包括：投影仪（Projector）、音响（Amplifier）、DVD 播放器（DvdPlayer）、灯光（Lights）、屏幕（Screen）。<br>要观看一部电影，我们需要依次执行以下操作： 1. 打开投影仪 2. 打开音响 3. 打开 DVD 播放器 4. 放下屏幕 5. 调暗灯光 6. 播放 DVD。<br>如果不用外观模式：</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Client</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(String[] args)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Projector</span> <span class="hljs-variable">projector</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Projector</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Amplifier</span> <span class="hljs-variable">amplifier</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Amplifier</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">DvdPlayer</span> <span class="hljs-variable">dvdPlayer</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DvdPlayer</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Lights</span> <span class="hljs-variable">lights</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Lights</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Screen</span> <span class="hljs-variable">screen</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Screen</span>();  <br>        projector.on();  <br>        amplifier.on();  <br>        dvdPlayer.on();  <br>        screen.down();  <br>        lights.dim(<span class="hljs-number">10</span>);  <br>        dvdPlayer.play(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;电影名称&quot;</span>);  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>客户端直接使用所有的设备，与不同的设备进行交互。<br>创建一个门面类屏蔽细节:</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">HomeTheaterFacade</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> Projector projector;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> Amplifier amplifier;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> DvdPlayer dvdPlayer;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> Lights lights;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> Screen screen;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-type">public</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">HomeTheaterFacade</span><span class="hljs-params">(Projector projector, Amplifier amplifier, DvdPlayer dvdPlayer, Lights lights, Screen screen)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.projector = projector;  <br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.amplifier = amplifier;  <br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.dvdPlayer = dvdPlayer;  <br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.lights = lights;  <br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.screen = screen;  <br>    &#125;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">watchMovie</span><span class="hljs-params">(String movie)</span> &#123;  <br>        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;准备观看电影...&quot;</span>);  <br>        projector.on();  <br>        amplifier.on();  <br>        dvdPlayer.on();  <br>        screen.down();  <br>        lights.dim(<span class="hljs-number">10</span>);  <br>        dvdPlayer.play(movie);  <br>    &#125;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">endMovie</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> &#123;  <br>        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;关闭家庭影院...&quot;</span>);  <br>        dvdPlayer.stop();  <br>        dvdPlayer.off();  <br>        screen.up();  <br>        lights.on();  <br>        projector.off();  <br>        amplifier.off();  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>客户端代码变为</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Client</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(String[] args)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Projector</span> <span class="hljs-variable">projector</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Projector</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Amplifier</span> <span class="hljs-variable">amplifier</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Amplifier</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">DvdPlayer</span> <span class="hljs-variable">dvdPlayer</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DvdPlayer</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Lights</span> <span class="hljs-variable">lights</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Lights</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Screen</span> <span class="hljs-variable">screen</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Screen</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">HomeTheaterFacade</span> <span class="hljs-variable">homeTheater</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">HomeTheaterFacade</span>(projector, amplifier, dvdPlayer, lights, screen);  <br>        homeTheater.watchMovie(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;流浪地球&quot;</span>);  <br>        homeTheater.endMovie();  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在实际的 Java 开发中，分层架构（如 MVC、DDD）的层与层之间经常使用外观模式的思想，每一层通过统一的接口（如 Service 类）对上层提供服务，隐藏内部实现细节。 可以看到系统更有层次，客户端-门面类-子系统。耦合度比较低，同时符合迪米特法则（最少知识原则），因为客户端的直接朋友只有门面类，而不是许多子系统。</p><h3 id="外观模式的坏处"><a href="#外观模式的坏处" class="headerlink" title="外观模式的坏处"></a>外观模式的坏处</h3><ol><li>可能成为“上帝对象”：如果门面类承担了过多的职责，把所有子系统的功能都集中到自己身上，会导致门面类变得庞大且难以维护，违背单一职责原则。 </li><li>可能隐藏重要功能：门面提供了一个简化的接口，但有些客户端可能需要访问子系统的更细粒度功能。如果门面没有提供相应的方法，客户端可能无法直接使用这些功能，除非绕过门面直接访问子系统（这会破坏外观模式的设计初衷）。</li><li>可能违反开闭原则：如果门面类需要随着子系统的变化而频繁修改，那么它可能会成为修改的集中点，增加维护成本。</li></ol>]]></content>
    
    
    
