  <entry>
    <title>策略模式</title>
    <link href="/2026/09/06/%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/"/>
    <url>/2026/09/06/%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>策略模式：行为设计模式。定义算法家族，分别封装起来，让他们之间可以相互替换，此模式让算法的变化，不会影响到使用算法的客户。<br>定义一系列算法的方法，从概念上来看，所用这些算法完成的都是相同的工作，只是实现不同，它可以以相同的方式调用所有的算法，减少了各种算法类与使用算法类之间的耦合。<br>策略模式是用来封装算法的，在实践中，可以用它来封装几乎任何类型的规则，只要在分析过程中听到需要在不同时间应用不同的业务规则，就可以考虑使用策略模式处理这种变化的可能性。</p><h3 id="实现"><a href="#实现" class="headerlink" title="实现"></a>实现</h3><p>包含三个角色：</p><ol><li>策略接口：定义策略类必须实现的公共方法，通常是一个接口或抽象类。</li><li>具体策略：实现策略接口，提供具体的算法或行为。</li><li>上下文：持有一个策略对象的引用，负责将客户端的请求委托给具体的策略对象执行。上下文可以动态改变所持有的策略。<br>以下例子，对商品价格进行打折，需要实现不同的打折算法（八折、超过300减100等），然后根据选择通过<code>if-else</code>或者<code>switch-case</code>进行判断。</li></ol><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Cashier</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculatePrice</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> type, <span class="hljs-type">double</span> originalPrice)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-variable">result</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> originalPrice;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">switch</span> (type) &#123;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>:  <br>                result = originalPrice;  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>:  <br>                result = originalPrice * <span class="hljs-number">0.8</span>;  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-number">3</span>:  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (originalPrice &gt; <span class="hljs-number">300</span>) &#123;  <br>                    result -= <span class="hljs-number">100</span>;  <br>                &#125;  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span>:  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>        &#125;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> result;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>存在问题：</p><ol><li>复用性差：每一种算法没有单独进行封装</li><li>违背开闭原则：新增算法，需要修改目前代码逻辑，新加判断和具体策略算法。</li><li>当前函数随着算法复杂和种类增多，会变得十分臃肿和难以维护。</li></ol><h4 id="策略模式改造："><a href="#策略模式改造：" class="headerlink" title="策略模式改造："></a>策略模式改造：</h4><p>策略接口</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">interface</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DiscountStrategy</span> &#123;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">double</span> price)</span>;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>具体策略类</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">NormalDiscount</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DiscountStrategy</span> &#123;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">double</span> price)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> price;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Discount8</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DiscountStrategy</span> &#123;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">double</span> price)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> price * <span class="hljs-number">0.8</span>;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Full300Reduce100</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DiscountStrategy</span> &#123;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">double</span> price)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (price &gt; <span class="hljs-number">300</span>) &#123;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> price - <span class="hljs-number">100</span>;  <br>        &#125;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> price;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>策略上下文</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">CashierContext</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-type">DiscountStrategy</span> <span class="hljs-variable">result</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">NormalDiscount</span>();  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculatePrice</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> type)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">switch</span> (type) &#123;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>:  <br>                result = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">NormalDiscount</span>();  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>:  <br>                result = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Discount8</span>();  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-number">3</span>:  <br>                result = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Full300Reduce100</span>();  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span>:  <br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>        &#125;  <br>    &#125;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculatePrice</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">double</span> originalPrice)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> result.calculate(originalPrice);  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol><li>将不同策略进行封装，新加的策略只需要实现接口，然后写自己的逻辑就好。单一职责，复用性好。</li><li>目前还是存在新增策略需要改Context类的判断逻辑，可以通过Spring自定义注解来注册Bean或者反射来进行优化。</li></ol>]]></content>
    
    
    
