  <entry>
    <title>迪米特法则</title>
    <link href="/2026/09/06/%E8%BF%AA%E7%B1%B3%E7%89%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99/"/>
    <url>/2026/09/06/%E8%BF%AA%E7%B1%B3%E7%89%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>前提：在类的结构设计上，每一类都应当尽力降低成员的访问权限。<br>迪米特法则：如果两个类不必彼此直接通信，那么这两个类就不应当发生直接的相互作用。如果其中一个类需要调用另一个类的某一个方法的话，可以通过第三者转发这个调用。<br>迪米特法则强调了类之间的松耦合。类之间的耦合越弱，越有利于复用，一个处在弱耦合的类被修改，不会对有关系的类造成波及。</p><h3 id="如何理解迪米特法则"><a href="#如何理解迪米特法则" class="headerlink" title="如何理解迪米特法则"></a>如何理解迪米特法则</h3><p>迪米特法则应该要求一个类应该只和自己的“直接朋友”聊天，而不应该“陌生人”聊天。<br>什么是“直接朋友”：</p><ol><li>当前对象本身：<code>this</code></li><li>方法参数中传入的对象</li><li>当前对象的成员变量</li><li>方法内部创建的对象<br>除此之外都为“陌生人”。</li></ol><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Employee</span> &#123;  <br>  <br>&#125;  <br>  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Department</span> &#123;  <br>    List&lt;Employee&gt; employeeList;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">List</span>&lt;Employee&gt; <span class="hljs-title function_">getEmployeeList</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> employeeList;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;  <br>  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Manager</span> &#123;  <br>    Department department;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">Department</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getDepartment</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> department;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;  <br>  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Boss</span> &#123;  <br>    Manager manager;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getDepartmentCount</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">List</span>&lt;Employee&gt; <span class="hljs-variable">employeeList</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> manager.getDepartment().getEmployeeList();  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> employeeList.size();  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>违背迪米特法则的部分是：<code>List&lt;Employee&gt; employeeList = manager.getDepartment().getEmployeeList();</code><br>Boss类的直接朋友是Manager，调用直接朋友的方法<code>manager.getDepartment()</code>方法是没问题的。但是<code>Department</code>不是他的直接朋友，调用<code>getEmployeeList()</code>方法应该通过第三方转发，而不是它直接调用。</p><h4 id="坏处"><a href="#坏处" class="headerlink" title="坏处"></a>坏处</h4><ol><li>Boss和Employee的耦合度很高，比如Employee类的List改变了，变为Set，Boss也要跟着变化。但是两个不是直接朋友，变化的范围到直接朋友应该就终止。</li><li>这种很长的链式调用容易出现NPE。</li></ol><h4 id="修改的版本"><a href="#修改的版本" class="headerlink" title="修改的版本"></a>修改的版本</h4><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Employee</span> &#123;  <br>  <br>&#125;  <br>  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Department</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> List&lt;Employee&gt; employeeList;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getEmployeeCount</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> employeeList.size();  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;  <br>  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Manager</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> Department department;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getEmployeeCount</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> department.getEmployeeCount();  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;  <br>  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Boss</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> Manager manager;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getEmployeeCount</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> manager.getEmployeeCount();  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>修改之后，每个类只和自己的朋友进行通信，改动的影响面限制比较小。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
    <tags>
      
      <tag>设计模式</tag>
      
    </tags>
    
