  <entry>
    <title>简单工厂设计模式</title>
    <link href="/2026/08/30/%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/"/>
    <url>/2026/08/30/%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>简单工厂设计模式<br>创建型设计模式。但是不属于23种设计模式。<br>提供一个工厂类，根据调用方传入的参数来决定创建哪一种具体产品类的实例。通常具体的产品类都会继承或者实现同一个抽象类或接口。</p><h2 id="如何实现一个简单工厂模式"><a href="#如何实现一个简单工厂模式" class="headerlink" title="如何实现一个简单工厂模式"></a>如何实现一个简单工厂模式</h2><p>包括三部分：</p><ol><li>产品接口&#x2F;抽象类：定义了产品的规范、行为。</li><li>具体产品：工厂的所有具体产品都应该继承或者实现抽象类或接口。</li><li>产品工厂：根据传入的参数返回对应的具体产品。<br>以计算器为例子实现简单工厂模式。<br>首先，产品接口&#x2F;抽象类的实现。</li></ol><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">abstract</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Operator</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">abstract</span> <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">double</span> numA, <span class="hljs-type">double</span> numB)</span>;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后，具体产品的实现，继承抽象类，实现对应的功能，以加法和减法为例。</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">AddOperator</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">extends</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Operator</span>&#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">double</span> numA, <span class="hljs-type">double</span> numB)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> numA + numB;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">SubOperator</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">extends</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Operator</span> &#123;  <br>  <br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">calculate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">double</span> numA, <span class="hljs-type">double</span> numB)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> numA - numB;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>最后，产品工厂的实现。</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">OperatorFactory</span> &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">Operator</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getOperator</span><span class="hljs-params">(String op)</span> &#123;  <br>        <span class="hljs-type">Operator</span> <span class="hljs-variable">result</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">switch</span> (op) &#123;  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;+&quot;</span> -&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">AddOperator</span>();  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;-&quot;</span> -&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">SubOperator</span>();  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;*&quot;</span> -&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">MulOperator</span>();  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/&quot;</span> -&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DivOperator</span>();  <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span> -&gt; <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>;  <br>        &#125;;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> result;  <br>    &#125;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="简单工厂模式的好处"><a href="#简单工厂模式的好处" class="headerlink" title="简单工厂模式的好处"></a>简单工厂模式的好处</h2><p>为什么要使用简单工厂模式，如果不使用简单工厂模式，客户端代码会变成类似这种：</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-type">Scanner</span> <span class="hljs-variable">scanner</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Scanner</span>(System.in);  <br><span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-variable">numA</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> scanner.nextDouble();  <br><span class="hljs-type">double</span> <span class="hljs-variable">numB</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> scanner.nextDouble();  <br><span class="hljs-type">String</span> <span class="hljs-variable">op</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> scanner.next();  <br>Operator operator;  <br><span class="hljs-keyword">switch</span> (op) &#123;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;+&quot;</span>:  <br>        operator = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">AddOperator</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;-&quot;</span>:  <br>        operator = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">SubOperator</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;*&quot;</span>:  <br>        operator = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">MulOperator</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/&quot;</span>:  <br>        operator = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DivOperator</span>();  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span>:  <br>        operator = <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>;  <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;  <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>会有两个问题：</p><ol><li>没有一个统一的管理，扩展性很差。如果工厂的创建在多处都有使用，出现很多重复代码。假设需要添加一个新的运算类<code>ModOperator</code>，或者修改某一个类<code>AddOperator</code>的构造方法从无参构造强制变为有参构造，那么所有涉及到运算对象创建的地方都要进行修改逻辑。</li><li>客户端的职责不单一。客户端应该是只负责业务逻辑，比如调用计算接口完成计算，得到结果。但是目前是创建对象、使用对象都放在客户端去做。<br>简单工厂模式解决了两个问题，<strong>客户端只依赖抽象接口和工厂，而不依赖具体产品类</strong>。将当前产品的创建逻辑统一进行管理修改的话只需要修改工厂，同时客户端不用关心代码是怎么创建的。</li></ol><h2 id="简单工厂模式的缺点"><a href="#简单工厂模式的缺点" class="headerlink" title="简单工厂模式的缺点"></a>简单工厂模式的缺点</h2><p>简单工厂模式中工厂和产品的<strong>解耦并不彻底</strong>。</p><ol><li>工厂类必须依赖所有的具体产品类，当产品类发生变化时，工厂类也要跟着变化。新增一个具体产品或者修改产品的构造方法，工厂类也要跟着进行变化。违反了开闭原则。</li><li>如果创建产品的流程比较复杂，需要读取配置、连接数据库、加载资源等，整个工厂类变得十分臃肿。</li></ol><h2 id="什么时候使用简单工厂模式"><a href="#什么时候使用简单工厂模式" class="headerlink" title="什么时候使用简单工厂模式"></a>什么时候使用简单工厂模式</h2><ol><li>产品类型相对较少，并且比较稳定。</li><li>多处需要创建同一产品对象，需要进行统一管理。</li></ol><h2 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h2><p>简单工厂模式通过引入工厂类，<strong>将客户端与具体产品类解耦</strong>，使客户端不再关心对象的创建细节，提升了代码的灵活性和可维护性。<br>但它<strong>并没有完全消除耦合</strong>，只是将耦合转移到了工厂类内部。当产品种类增多时，工厂类需要不断修改，违反开闭原则。因此，简单工厂模式适用于<strong>产品种类较少且相对稳定</strong>的场景。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
